{
    "title": "\u30d8\u30a2&\u30d3\u30e5\u30fc\u30c6\u30a3\u30fc\u30b5\u30ed\u30f3\u691c\u7d22/\u30db\u30c3\u30c8\u30da\u30c3\u30d1\u30fc\u30d3\u30e5\u30fc\u30c6\u30a3\u30fc",
    "description": "Hot Pepper Beauty is a search and reservation application for the largest hair, nail, eyelash, relax and beauty salon in Japan. You can search and reserve a salon anytime, anywhere from the app 24 hours.\r\n\r\n\u25a0\u25a0\u25a0 You can find the perfect salon for you \u25a0\u25a0\u25a0\u25a0\r\n\r\n\u25a0 World's largest publication information\r\n\u30fb More than 70,000 hair salons and beauty salons!\r\n-More than 150,000 registered hair salon stylists!\r\n-More than 70 million reservations per year!\r\n\r\nFrom the largest information in Japan, you can find the perfect salon for you.\r\n\r\n\u25a0 It supports wide genre!\r\n\r\nYou can easily search and reserve hair salons, nail salons, beauty salons and relax massages.\r\n\r\n\u25a0 You can search for salons in your area quickly\r\n\r\nNot only the area and the nearest station, you can also search from your favorite search axis such as desired date, coupon, hair color, Matsueku etc.\r\n\r\n\u25a0 A lot of salon information is also posted\r\n\r\nIn addition to sales information, maps and photos that show the atmosphere, there are plenty of valuable coupon information!\r\nWith over 4 million word-of-mouth reviews, you can know salon information in advance.\r\n\r\n\u00a0\r\n\r\n\u25a0\u25a0\u25a0 Easy online reservation that can be used anytime \u25a0\u25a0\u25a0\r\n\r\nOnce you decide which salon you want to go to, make an online reservation from the app!\r\n\r\n\u30fb Reservations are possible 24 hours a day.\r\n\u30fb Appoint a hairdresser or salon staff to make a reservation.\r\n-Earn points when you book online. Use your accumulated points to make online booking even more rewarding!\r\n\r\n\u00a0\r\n\r\n\u25a0\u25a0\u25a0 The largest hair catalog and nail catalog in Japan \u25a0\u25a0\u25a0\r\n\r\n\u25a0 A hair catalog with more than 2.5 million styles\r\nYou can also search by hair type and face type, so you will surely find the style you want!\r\nYou can also see information on styling points and provided salons in detail.\r\n\r\n\u25a0 Nail catalog with over 400,000 designs\r\nYou can find the perfect design for you from various aspects such as scenes, colors and designs.\r\nYou can also make a salon reservation from the hair catalog and nail catalog search.\r\n\r\n\u25a0\u25a0\u25a0 A lot of other useful functions \u25a0\u25a0\u25a0\r\n\r\n\u30fb You can bookmark the salon, hair catalog, and nail catalog to be checked later.\r\n\u30fb Bookmarks can be linked with the Web Hot Pepper Beauty.\r\n-Coupons for cut models are now available! We can make a reservation for advantageous.\r\n\u30fb You can also search for salons recommended for men.\r\n\u30fb Many blogs from salons are posted!",
    "descriptionHTML": "Hot Pepper Beauty is a search and reservation application for the largest hair, nail, eyelash, relax and beauty salon in Japan. You can search and reserve a salon anytime, anywhere from the app 24 hours.<br><br>\u25a0\u25a0\u25a0 You can find the perfect salon for you \u25a0\u25a0\u25a0\u25a0<br><br>\u25a0 World&#39;s largest publication information<br>\u30fb More than 70,000 hair salons and beauty salons!<br>-More than 150,000 registered hair salon stylists!<br>-More than 70 million reservations per year!<br><br>From the largest information in Japan, you can find the perfect salon for you.<br><br>\u25a0 It supports wide genre!<br><br>You can easily search and reserve hair salons, nail salons, beauty salons and relax massages.<br><br>\u25a0 You can search for salons in your area quickly<br><br>Not only the area and the nearest station, you can also search from your favorite search axis such as desired date, coupon, hair color, Matsueku etc.<br><br>\u25a0 A lot of salon information is also posted<br><br>In addition to sales information, maps and photos that show the atmosphere, there are plenty of valuable coupon information!<br>With over 4 million word-of-mouth reviews, you can know salon information in advance.<br><br>\u00a0<br><br>\u25a0\u25a0\u25a0 Easy online reservation that can be used anytime \u25a0\u25a0\u25a0<br><br>Once you decide which salon you want to go to, make an online reservation from the app!<br><br>\u30fb Reservations are possible 24 hours a day.<br>\u30fb Appoint a hairdresser or salon staff to make a reservation.<br>-Earn points when you book online. Use your accumulated points to make online booking even more rewarding!<br><br>\u00a0<br><br>\u25a0\u25a0\u25a0 The largest hair catalog and nail catalog in Japan \u25a0\u25a0\u25a0<br><br>\u25a0 A hair catalog with more than 2.5 million styles<br>You can also search by hair type and face type, so you will surely find the style you want!<br>You can also see information on styling points and provided salons in detail.<br><br>\u25a0 Nail catalog with over 400,000 designs<br>You can find the perfect design for you from various aspects such as scenes, colors and designs.<br>You can also make a salon reservation from the hair catalog and nail catalog search.<br><br>\u25a0\u25a0\u25a0 A lot of other useful functions \u25a0\u25a0\u25a0<br><br>\u30fb You can bookmark the salon, hair catalog, and nail catalog to be checked later.<br>\u30fb Bookmarks can be linked with the Web Hot Pepper Beauty.<br>-Coupons for cut models are now available! We can make a reservation for advantageous.<br>\u30fb You can also search for salons recommended for men.<br>\u30fb Many blogs from salons are posted!",
